[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766014406","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104835#issuecomment-2766014406","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104835","id":2766014406,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k3gfG","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T12:01:57Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T12:03:11Z","body":"Hi, thanks for reporting!\nI am using exceptions in my GDExtension, and setting `disable_exceptions` to `false` works fine for me:\n\nhttps://github.com/Ivorforce/NumDot/blob/c8b559fcdb55b6a23d90a23652ba064990b4503b/SConstruct#L55-L58\nYou can see it works for web in the demo: https://ivorius.itch.io/numdot-demos\n\nPerhaps your problem has a different cause?\n\nEdit: My project is notably on 4.3.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766014406/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766100918","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104835#issuecomment-2766100918","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104835","id":2766100918,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k31m2","user":{"login":"Bromeon","id":708488,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwODQ4OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/708488?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon","html_url":"https://github.com/Bromeon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Bromeon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T12:39:04Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T12:39:04Z","body":"Web export also works in godot-rust in current Godot, i.e. without such a flag. While Rust doesn't have exceptions, it has panics, which (afaik) use the same mechanism.\n\nWe do use the following _LLVM_ flag when calling `emcc` though:\n```properties\n  -Cllvm-args=-enable-emscripten-cxx-exceptions=0\n```\n\nSee also configuration in [our book](https://godot-rust.github.io/book/toolchain/export-web.html?highlight=config.toml#project-configuration).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766100918/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2766509930","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104835#issuecomment-2766509930","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104835","id":2766509930,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k5Zdq","user":{"login":"hiugiak","id":22273250,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjczMjUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22273250?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak","html_url":"https://github.com/hiugiak","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hiugiak/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T14:58:07Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T14:58:07Z","body":"> Web export also works in godot-rust in current Godot, i.e. without such a flag. While Rust doesn't have exceptions, it has panics, which (afaik) use the same mechanism.\n> \n> We do use the following _LLVM_ flag when calling `emcc` though:\n> \n>   -Cllvm-args=-enable-emscripten-cxx-exceptions=0\n> See also configuration in [our book](https://godot-rust.github.io/book/toolchain/export-web.html?highlight=config.toml#project-configuration).\n\nI'm developing my extension with C++, and the problem is I have to enable exceptions because some third-party libs require that.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":